<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait private deposits rise in January.</title>
<headline>Kuwait private deposits rise in January.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private sector deposits with banks in Kuwait rose to 7.045 billion dinars at the end of January from 6.981 billion at the end of December, Central Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The deposits stood at 7.071 billion in January 1996.</p>
<p>			   Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				  Jan '97    Dec '96    Jan '96</p>
<p>Dinar deposits		5,749.3    5,724.1    5,746.9</p>
<p>Foreign currency deposits 1,295.4    1,256.5    1,324.3</p>
<p>($1 = 0.303 dinar)</p>
</text>
